name: sim.getEngineBoolParam
description: Deprecated. See properties instead
luaSynopsis: bool boolParam = sim.getEngineBoolParam(int paramId, int objectHandle)
pythonSynopsis: bool boolParam = sim.getEngineBoolParam(int paramId, int objectHandle)
inputs:
1. paramId: engine parameter identifier
2. objectHandle: handle of the shape or joint, or -1 to retrieve a global engine parameter
outputs:
1. boolParam: value of the requested parameter
